SourceDateEpoch: 1738906514
Architecture: arm_cortex-a7_neon-vfpv4
Installed-Size: 2491
Filename: ipq-wifi-8dev_habanero-dvk_1_arm_cortex-a7_neon-vfpv4.ipk
Size: 3408
SHA256sum: 2592d16819bc2ae08e219c7478e3de83dcdee9b4e28aceef1dafda46612cc6bf
Description:  The 8devices Habanero DVK requires board-specific, reference ("cal") data
 that is not yet present in the upstream wireless firmware distribution.
 
 This package supplies board-2.bin file(s) that, in the interim,
 overwrite those supplied by the ath10k-firmware-* packages.
 
 This is package is only necessary for the 8devices Habanero DVK.
 
 Do not install it for any other device!

